**IMPORTANT — DATA_NOT_FOUND is NOT a failure.**
DIAG-API-03 returning `DATA_NOT_FOUND` simply means the supplier data source has no record for this GTIN. This is normal and expected — do NOT list it under FAILURES. Only list actual errors (API_ERROR, AUTH_ERROR, PARSE_FAILURE, SERVICE_ERROR, UPSTREAM_ERROR, etc.) as failures.

